            "
          >
            Long story short
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
  padding="14px 12px 0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 1px;
    "
  >
    Global Affairs
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Sri Lanka has taken control of the Iranian naval vessel IRINS Bushehr after allowing it to dock in Trincomalee due to engine failure,</strong> evacuating 208 crew members. The move came a day after a US submarine sank the Iranian frigate IRIS Dena near Sri Lankan waters, killing at least 87 people in an escalation of US-Israeli strikes on Iran. President Dissanayake upheld neutrality and humanitarian values amid the search for the missing crew (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c747vezn7zwo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Sri Lanka intervenes</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Finland is moving to lift a Cold War-era ban on importing nuclear weapons, a step the government says aligns with its role in NATO.</strong> The move follows US-Israeli strikes on Iran under Operation Epic Fury over failed nuclear talks, alongside the ongoing Russia-Ukraine war along Finland's eastern border. Officials stress the policy shift bolsters national security without immediate deployment plans (<a href="https://www.newsweek.com/finland-lifts-cold-war-ban-nuclear-weapons-import-11628689" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Finland defense pivot</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Business &amp; Markets
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>A US federal judge has rejected xAI's bid to temporarily block a California law requiring AI firms to disclose summaries of the data used to train their models.</strong> The judge ruled that the company had not shown that the law likely violates open speech rights. The law, signed by Gavin Newsom in 2024, took effect on January 1 and forms part of California’s broader effort to regulate generative AI companies and increase transparency (<a href="https://today.westlaw.com/Document/Idcc3626018dc11f1998984f7baa87685/View/FullText.html?transitionType=CategoryPageItem&amp;contextData=(sc.Default)&amp;firstPage=true" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">AI disclosure fight</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Nike expects to record about $300M in pre-tax severance charges as part of a restructuring push.</strong> The company cut roughly 775 US jobs in January to accelerate automation, while its subsidiary, Converse, is also trimming corporate roles. The charges will appear in the third quarter of fiscal 2026 (<a href="https://money.usnews.com/investing/news/articles/2026-03-05/nike-records-300-million-in-restructuring-charges-after-recent-layoffs" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">automation push</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Meta faces a US lawsuit alleging its AI-powered smart glasses violated privacy and misled consumers through false advertising of user control and security.</strong> Meta claimed it was blurring faces in images, but sources disputed that this blurring consistently worked. Over 7Mn units sold in 2025 feed non-opt-out data pipelines, prompting UK regulatory scrutiny (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/05/meta-sued-over-ai-smartglasses-privacy-concerns-after-workers-reviewed-nudity-sex-and-other-footage/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">privacy lawsuit</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Science &amp; Tech
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="0px 12px 10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Science &amp; Tech"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Nothing unveiled the midrange Nothing Phone (4a) and Nothing Phone (4a) Pro,</strong> featuring distinctive Glyph lighting, Snapdragon 7-series chips, 5,080-mAh batteries, and quick charging. The Pro model adds a brighter 144-Hz display, a metal unibody, and an improved Sony camera with 3.5x optical zoom, Nothing OS 4.1 on Android 16, and three OS upgrades. However, just the Phone (4a) Pro will launch in the US, starting at $499 (<a href="https://www.wired.com/story/nothing-phone-4a-and-phone-4a-pro-and-headphone-a/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Nothing 4a debut</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Astronomers using the Atacama Large Millimeter/submillimeter Array (ALMA) have produced the most detailed image yet of the turbulent core of the Milky Way</strong>. The dataset reveals a vast network of cold gas filaments across the galaxy’s Central Molecular Zone. This region surrounds the galaxy’s supermassive black hole and contains dense clouds where stars form. It spans more than 650 light-years and represents the largest image mosaic ever produced by ALMA (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/03/260305182705.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Milky Way mosaic</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Whatnot
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">OpenAI unveils GPT-5.4 with improved efficiency and advanced reasoning tasks (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/05/openai-launches-gpt-5-4-with-pro-and-thinking-versions/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">OpenAI upgrade</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">China explores giant airborne turbines as the next step in wind energy innovation (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/climate/china-floating-wind-turbine-sawes-c2e-spc" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">wind test</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Ocean temperature cycles could be quietly protecting Earth from a planet-wide drought (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/03/260304184229.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">climate buffer</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Iran is using affordable drones to cause chaos across the Middle East (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/resources/idt-b3a272f0-3e10-4f95-9cd1-b34ab8ad033c" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">see how</a>).</p>
</mj-text>

